  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "把快餐车变成游戏小店",
        "en": "A food truck for pretend play"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-383A/0a0e3688bf34.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "车身图案、遮篷与售卖窗口组成快餐车场景。可以从窗口接单、招呼顾客，或围绕出车与停车编一个故事，食品道具可自行搭配。",
        "en": "Vehicle graphics, an awning and a service window create a food-truck setting. Players can take orders through the window or invent a story about driving and parking the truck. Food props can be added separately."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "按说明组装车体",
        "en": "Assemble the truck with the included guide"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-383A/5b878c3a080c.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "这款需要组装，随附说明书。组装后的尺寸为117 × 69 × 79 cm，既要预留帐篷占地，也要给入口和售卖窗口留出活动位置。",
        "en": "Assembly is required and instructions are included. The assembled dimensions are 117 × 69 × 79 cm. Allow space for the tent itself and around the entrance and service window."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "3岁及以上，彩盒装",
        "en": "Ages 3+ and color-box packing"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A999-383A/1b62cc6b7899.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "盒面标注3岁及以上。布面、遮篷与窗口的细节在配图中展示，单品彩盒尺寸39 × 8 × 25 cm，货号A999-383A。",
        "en": "The box is marked for ages 3 and above. The images show the fabric, awning and window details. The individual color box measures 39 × 8 × 25 cm; model A999-383A."
      }
    }
  ],
